# API & Infra Conventions

## Auth

- Public: `/authentication/register`, `/login`, `/refresh-token`
- Protected: middleware `Auth(jwtSecret)`
- Access vs refresh dibedakan lewat claim `type`
- Token expired message: `"Unauthorized: Token expired"` (selaras Wisteria interceptor)

## Headers

- `apikey: <API_KEY>` wajib di `/api/v1`
- `Authorization: Bearer <accessToken>` untuk route protected

## Redis

- Cache read-through di service layer
- Invalidate list/detail pada create/update/delete
- Key pattern: `product:{id}`, `products:user:{userId}`

## RabbitMQ

- Publish dari service setelah persist sukses
- Routing key contoh: `product.created`
- Worker di `cmd/worker` consume + ack
- Jika MQ down saat boot API: log warn, lanjut tanpa event (jangan crash API)
- Publish event boleh async via `go func()` + `context.WithTimeout(context.Background(), ...)`
  (jangan reuse request context — bisa cancel saat handler return)

## Goroutine (contoh di project)

- `cmd/api`: `go ListenAndServe` supaya main bisa tunggu OS signal + graceful shutdown
- `product` service: `go publishProductCreatedAsync` supaya HTTP response tidak nunggu MQ

## REST resources

- Plural nouns: `/products`
- Method: GET list/detail, POST create, PUT update, DELETE delete
- Ownership check di service (`userId` match) → `ErrForbidden`
